   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c181c2fd-e02e-4f15-8d8a-0a04c4223058"],
 " objects, one per insertion (a single-element list when called on a bare \
topology)."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"052baeac-f7f2-4a77-9173-b254739e4dcf"]
